    "title": "Advances in digital camera-based phenotyping of Botrytis disease development",
    "authors": [
      "Laura Groenenberg",
      "Marie Duhamel",
      "Yuling Bai",
      "Mark G.M. Aarts",
      "Gerrit Polder",
      "Theo A.J. van der Lee"
    ],
    "author_ids": [
